                                "translation": "a spherical object with a diameter of 27 centimetres",
                                "english": "a spherical object with a diameter of 27 centimetres"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04db3f1e-9c74-42e9-9b12-1e0ef9e3f9cf",
                                "sense_id": "9011afb8-d803-3e2d-8e2d-c1c8a4bba278",
                                "text": "On obtient la circonférence d'un cercle ou d'une sphère en multipliant son diamètre par le nombre π [pi].",
                                "translation": "The circumference of a circle or sphere can be obtained by multiplying its diameter by the number π.",
                                "english": "The circumference of a circle or sphere can be obtained by multiplying its diameter by the number π."
                            },
                            {
